Package: fmrigds
Type: Package
Title: Lazy, Format-Agnostic Group Analysis for fMRI
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Authors@R: c(
    person("Brad", "Buchsbaum", email = "brad.buchsbaum@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Provides lazy, spatially typed group-analysis plans for
    observation-by-feature fMRI frames together with compatibility workflows
    for first-level statistical outputs represented as sample by subject by
    contrast Group Data Sets (GDS). Supports bounded feature-block reducers,
    tabular, NIfTI, HDF5, and fmristore inputs, space-aware transformations,
    provenance tracking, and reproducible export.
